=== The Holy Ghost the Comforter
# from 1955, 12761
--- The Comforter shall teach you all things
kicker: The Holy Ghost the Comforter
big: John 14:26 | mark: he shall teach you all things
p: Jesus tells them the nature of the 3rd person of the trinity, the Holy Ghost. The Comforter. Who, dwelling within us gives us discernment to understand the word, as He teaches us all things and brings to remembrance those doctrines and scripture we've been taught.
p: In Him is peace, to not be troubled or afraid.

# from 520, 12761
--- He will reprove the world
kicker: The Holy Ghost the Comforter
scripture: John 16:8-11 | mark: he will reprove the world of sin, and of righteousness, and of judgment
p: All men are called by the Spirit, God the Father having lifted up the Son, because the Spirit of the Comforter works to reprove the world of sin, righteousness and judgment. That they may know they need salvation, and believe.
p: When the Holy Spirit talks to you, have an ear to listen. That comes from prayer and reading and reflecting on God's word throughout the day.

# from 12761, 10835
--- Sealed unto the day of redemption
kicker: The Holy Ghost the Comforter
scripture: Ephesians 1:13-14 | mark: ye were sealed with that holy Spirit of promise, Which is the earnest of our inheritance
p: Earnest is money, sometimes called a “good faith deposit,” a sum that is included with your offer to purchase something to show your seriousness of intent to go through with the purchase, which is also called redemption. The Spirit is the earnest of God, given in Christ, sealing us as His until the resurrection, whereby we are redeemed.
refs: Ephesians 4:30; Romans 8:16

# from 10837
--- The Spirit maketh intercession
kicker: The Holy Ghost the Comforter
big: Romans 8:26 | mark: the Spirit itself maketh intercession for us
p: The Spirit, if we let Him, works on our infirmities, helps us with removing the thorns in our hearts that otherwise lead us to sin. He heals us as we walk in the Spirit.
p: But more, the Spirit is an intercessor, bringing our needs before the Father, even that which we don't know we have, that His will be done through us.

# from 12781, 12782
--- Spiritually discerned
kicker: The Holy Ghost the Comforter
big: 1 Corinthians 2:14 | mark: because they are spiritually discerned
p: Without first believing the Gospel, preached by the power of the word of God, and the understanding by the Spirit, the things of God are foolishness to man. The Holy Ghost teaches, not the wisdom of men, not of the world, but the spiritual things of God. Comparing spiritual things with spiritual.
p: As we seek, so too He gives wisdom and understanding freely, through the Spirit within us.

# from 14588, 5568, 16479
--- Oil and living waters
kicker: The Holy Ghost the Comforter
lead: In scripture, oil is almost always a picture of the holy Spirit.
panel: The widow's oil | Just as we who are saved are filled with the Spirit, and we can fill others, as vessels, infinitely. It never runs out. [[2 Kings 4:1-7]]
panel: The ten virgins | The oil is the Holy Spirit, the lamps, our hearts. It is not the wise's to give or share. Each must get their own from Christ. [[Matthew 25:1-13]]
panel: Rivers of living water | If you are like the believer in John 7, you are a tree bearing fruit, and from you flows the Spirit, living waters, His word. [[John 7:38-39]]
