=== The name above every name
# from 17684, 15880
--- The excellent name of the Lord
kicker: The name above every name
big: Philippians 2:9-11 | mark: a name which is above every name
p: Jesus is the name of the Lord. Of the great I Am. No other name is given by God to be worshipped as God.
big: Acts 4:12 | mark: none other name under heaven given among men, whereby we must be saved

# from 17935, 18028
--- Thou art the Christ [title]
overline: God, Christ & the Holy Ghost
heading: Thou art the Christ
center: Faith in this truth is what is required of man to be saved.
big: 1 John 5:1 | mark: Whosoever believeth that Jesus is the Christ is born of God
center: God Himself testifies with us the truth of His Son. Amen.
